- Warm headless dense1m: transit2 −88%, final −74%, prepTransit −69%, commute.end −66%, prep −62%, commute.pool −60%, final2 −55%, transit −52%, roundMatch −47%, roundSearch −37%, shop −14%, freight −12%, inbound +2%, parking +16%, cached shop/freight +160-230%.
- Cold (the 60 d --warm 20 run): −42% to −94% for every step.
- Traffic cycle: 22.9 estimated ms against 32-39 warm, 91-104 cold.

